\Section{Jinja essentials}
\begin{tabular}{p{1.30in} p{6.10in}}
Variable & {% raw %}\Code{\{\{ job\_ref.company \}\}}{% endraw %} inserts a value. \\
Default & {% raw %}\Code{\{\{ value | default('Fallback') \}\}}{% endraw %} supplies a fallback. \\
Conditional & {% raw %}\Code{\{\% if job\_ref.score \%\} ... \{\% endif \%\}}{% endraw %}. \\
Loop & {% raw %}\Code{\{\% for item in work\_exp \%\} ... \{\% endfor \%\}}{% endraw %}. \\
Trusted LaTeX & {% raw %}\Code{\{\{ latex\_raw(value) \}\}}{% endraw %} bypasses automatic escaping. \\
\end{tabular}

